	And I create a note for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Agent Name | Koroneiki User        |
	| Content    | Account Note1 Content |
	| Format     | Plain                 |
	| Priority   | 2                     |
	| Status     | Approved              |
	| Type       | General               |
	And I update a note on koroneiki for the account "Korpro - ${staticCompanyName}" with the content "Account Note1 Content" to have the following values
	| Agent Name | Koroneiki User        |
	| Content    | Account Note2 Content |
